/P 593 0 R
/E (The RASC offers observing certificates for members who observe all objects in each of the following lists: the Messier Catalogue, the Finest NGC Catalogue, the Deep-Sky Challenge Objects and Deep-Sky Gems. It also offers the Explore the Universe Certificate for novice observers, the Explore the Moon Certificate for beginning members, and the Isabel Williamson Lunar Observing Certificate and the Double Stars Observing Certificate for intermediate to advanced members. Astroimaging certificates are available for those with a photographic bent.)
